stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Submitted : submit for review
    Submitted --> Approved : manager approves
    Submitted --> Rejected : declined or rework required
    Rejected --> Draft : revise proposal
    Approved --> Committed : plan lock / schedule commit
    Committed --> Active : work starts
    Active --> Released : project ends or resource exits
    Active --> Adjusted : re-baseline / partial change
    Adjusted --> Approved : new version approved
    Committed --> Cancelled : plan withdrawn
    Active --> Cancelled : cancellation during execution
    Released --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Approved
      hard allocation: protected against silent change
    end note

    note right of Committed
      capacity commitment becomes visible in snapshoting
    end note
